---
title: "1Zpresso — K-Max"
description: "A high-end hand grinder with precise external adjustment, built for people who dial in every cup."
date: "2026-10-27"
tags: ["grinder", "hand grinder"]
brand: "1Zpresso"
category: "Hand grinder"
---

The K-Max is near the top of the 1Zpresso lineup. The adjustment is precise and easy to read, and it grinds fast for a hand grinder. It handles everything from espresso to French press.

It costs more than most of the others here, but if coffee is your hobby it's a grinder you won't outgrow. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
